OL,4,CPlans submitted for city centre        
OL,5,Chomeless hostel                        
OL,6,GPlans have been submitted to convert a 
OL,7,Gvacant training centre into a city     
OL,8,Gcentre homeless hostel.                
OL,10,FHull City Council's planning           
OL,11,Fapplication wants to change the use of 
OL,12,Fthe old St James Enterprise Centre, on 
OL,13,FSt James Street in Hull, into hostel   
OL,14,Faccommodation for rough sleepers.      
OL,16,FThe proposal includes creating 10      
OL,17,Fdormitories, welfare sanitary          
OL,18,Ffacilities, and a first-floor place of 
OL,19,Fsafety area, but does not state how    
OL,20,Fmany people the hostel would           
OL,21,Faccommodate.                           
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
