OL,4,C'Mrs Christmas' hosting last dinner    
OL,5,Cfor those alone                        
OL,6,GA woman nicknamed "Mrs Christmas" is   
OL,7,Ggearing up to host her final annual    
OL,8,GChristmas lunch for those who would    
OL,9,Gotherwise spend the festive period     
OL,10,Galone.                                 
OL,12,FGloria Stewart, 77, has been           
OL,13,Forganising 'Home Alone at Christmas'   
OL,14,Fdinners in Sheffield since 2007 and is 
OL,15,Fnow set to hand over the baton due to  
OL,16,Fill health.                            
OL,18,FShe brings hundreds together for a     
OL,19,Fspecial meal each year, with about 400 
OL,20,Fpeople expected to attend her final    
OL,21,FChristmas lunch in Hillsborough in     
OL,22,FDecember.                         G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
