OL,4,CVictims say they lost #64k to 'cowboy  
OL,5,Cbuilder'                               
OL,6,GTwo victims of a jailed "cowboy        
OL,7,Gbuilder" who defrauded their families  
OL,8,Gout of more than #64,000 say he has    
OL,9,Ghad a devastating impact on their      
OL,10,Glives.                                 
OL,12,FJamie Martin, 35, of no fixed abode,   
OL,13,Fpleaded guilty to two counts of fraud  
OL,14,Fand was sentenced to three years and   
OL,15,Ftwo months in prison after a hearing   
OL,16,Fat Lincoln Crown Court on 29 October.  
OL,18,FEmma-Jayne Kelly said she lost nearly  
OL,19,F#40,000 to the "larger-than-life"      
OL,20,Fbuilder when he failed to complete an  
OL,21,Fextension to her home in Anwick,       
OL,22,FLincolnshire.                     G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
